This repository is a private historical archive. It reconstructs the ARLF framework from personal
conversational records for archival and research purposes.

The records reproduced here are excerpts of the owner's own AI conversation history. Critique and
endorsement attributed to named individuals within those records are simulated personas generated by
a language model and are not statements by those individuals. Published works cited as structural
seeds remain the property of their authors, who had no involvement in this framework.

